<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/29/eng@/~cl_7__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Any application for and issuance, of a Certificate of Approval in respect of the efficient use of electricity under the principal Act which is pending on the date of the coming into operation of this Act shall be deemed to have been made and shall be dealt with by the Commission under the relevant provisions of the Energy Efficiency and Conservation Act 2023 [Act...]."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/29/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/29/eng@/~cl_7__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/29/eng@/~cl_7> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/29/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/29/eng@/~cl_7__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "2" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/29/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/29/eng@/~cl_7__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/29/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/29/eng@/~cl_7__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Any Certificate of Approval in respect of the efficient use of electricity which has been issued under the principal Act and is in force immediately before the date of coming into operation of this Act shall, on the date of the coming into operation of this Act, be deemed to have been issued under the Energy Efficiency and Conservation Act 2023 and shall remain valid until the Certificate of Approval is expired or revoked by the Commission."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/29/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/29/eng@/~cl_7__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/29/eng@/~cl_7> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/29/eng@> .
