<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/29/eng@/~cl_7__subsec_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/29/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/29/eng@/~cl_7__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Any energy performance testing report, made in respect of the efficient use of electricity under the principal Act immediately before the date of coming into operation of this Act shall be deemed to have been validly made under the Energy Efficiency and Conservation Act 2023 and remain valid for the period of five years from the date of the report or until the report is revoked by the Commission."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/29/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/29/eng@/~cl_7__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/29/eng@/~cl_7> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/29/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/29/eng@/~cl_7__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "4" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/29/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/29/eng@/~cl_7__subsec_4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/29/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/29/eng@/~cl_7__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "Any notice, order or prohibition issued by the Commission in respect of the efficient use of electricity immediately before the date of coming into operation of this Act shall, on the date of coming into operation of this Act, be discontinued."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/29/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/29/eng@/~cl_7__subsec_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/29/eng@/~cl_7> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/29/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/29/eng@/~cl_7__subsec_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "5" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/29/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/29/eng@/~cl_7__subsec_5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/29/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/29/eng@/~cl_7__subsec_5> <https://schema.org/text> "Any action, seizure, prosecution or proceedings taken, made, commenced or pending in respect of the efficient use of electricity immediately before the date of coming into operation of this Act shall, on the date of coming into operation of this Act, be continued as if the principal Act had not been amended by this Act."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/29/eng@> .
