<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/29/eng@/~cl_7__subsec_6> <https://schema.org/text> "Any provision in the subsidiary legislation made under the deleted paragraphs 53(xa), (xj) and (xk) of the principal Act shall remain in operation until revoked or replaced by the subsidiary legislation made under the Energy Efficiency and Conservation Act 2023."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/29/eng@> .
